-- The composed row is checked by the same drives as zero-budget `fip`: a
-- recursive call feeding a multiplication fails its `bounded_stack` fact with
-- the same witness a `fip` claim would draw, differing only in the claim the
-- diagnostic names and the weakening the message suggests.
fn shrink(n : Int) : Int @ {bounded_stack, linear, noalloc} =
  if n == 0 then
    1
  else
    shrink(n - 1) * 2
